#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:558
msgid "Go to Cookies tab"
msgstr "Pojdite na zavihek Piškotki"

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:572
msgid ""
"This site uses a cookie consent banner powered by Kansleri Cookie Consent. "
"When you interact with the banner, a cookie named <code>kncc_consent</code> "
"is stored in your browser for up to 1 year. It records your consent "
"preferences (which cookie categories you accepted or rejected) so the site "
"can remember your choice on future visits. No personal data is stored in "
"this cookie."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto uporablja pasico za privolitev v piškotke, ki deluje z "
"vtičnikom Kansleri Cookie Consent. Ko uporabite pasico, se v vašem "
"brskalniku za največ 1 leto shrani piškotek z imenom "
"<code>kncc_consent</code>. V njem so zabeležene vaše nastavitve privolitve "
"(katere kategorije piškotkov ste sprejeli ali zavrnili), da si spletno mesto "
"lahko zapomni vašo izbiro ob prihodnjih obiskih. V tem piškotku se ne "
"shranjujejo nobeni osebni podatki."

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:573
msgid ""
"The plugin also records anonymous, aggregated consent statistics (how many "
"visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies each day) and individual "
"consent log entries for GDPR audit compliance. Consent log entries contain a"
" hashed (non-reversible) visitor identifier, the consent choice, which "
"categories were accepted, and the policy version. No IP addresses, user "
"identifiers, or personal data are stored in plain text. Consent log records "
"are automatically deleted after 13 months."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik beleži tudi anonimno, združeno statistiko privolitev (koliko "
"obiskovalcev je vsak dan sprejelo, zavrnilo ali prilagodilo piškotke) in "
"posamezne zapise v dnevniku privolitev za skladnost z revizijskimi zahtevami "
"GDPR. Zapisi v dnevniku privolitev vsebujejo zgoščeni (nepovratni) "
"identifikator obiskovalca, izbiro privolitve, sprejete kategorije in "
"različico politike. Nobeni naslovi IP, identifikatorji uporabnikov ali "
"osebni podatki se ne shranjujejo v berljivi obliki. Zapisi v dnevniku "
"privolitev se samodejno izbrišejo po 13 mesecih."

