"mogoče najti, navedeni pod »Morda odstranjeni«. Preglejte seznam in z gumbom "
"Odstrani izbrane piškotke izbrišite zapise, ki jih ne potrebujete več – nič "
"se ne odstrani samodejno."

#: includes/class-admin.php:797
msgid "Current consent status"
msgstr "Trenutno stanje privolitve"

#: includes/class-admin.php:797
msgid ""
"The [kncc_cookie_policy] shortcode shows each category as allowed, denied, "
"or not yet chosen above the Edit cookie preferences button. When WP Consent "
"API is active, a note explains the technical wp_consent_* cookie names used "
"by WordPress plugins."
msgstr ""
"Kratka koda [kncc_cookie_policy] nad gumbom Uredi nastavitve piškotkov "
"prikaže vsako kategorijo kot dovoljeno, zavrnjeno ali še neizbrano. Ko je "
"aktiven WP Consent API, opomba pojasni tehnična imena piškotkov "
"wp_consent_*, ki jih uporabljajo vtičniki za WordPress."

#: includes/class-admin.php:806
msgid "WP Consent API sync"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija z WP Consent API"

#: includes/class-admin.php:806
msgid ""
"When the WP Consent API plugin is active, Kansleri automatically syncs your "
"banner choices to wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, "
"wp_consent_marketing, and wp_consent_preferences. This lets consent-aware "
"plugins such as Google Site Kit read the visitor's choice. Banner labels "
"(Necessary, Analytics) map to these technical cookie names."
msgstr ""
"Ko je aktiven vtičnik WP Consent API, Kansleri samodejno sinhronizira izbire "
"iz vaše pasice v wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, "
"wp_consent_marketing in wp_consent_preferences. Tako lahko vtičniki, ki "
"upoštevajo privolitev, kot je Google Site Kit, preberejo izbiro obiskovalca. "
"Oznake v pasici (Nujni, Analitika) se preslikajo v ta tehnična imena "
"piškotkov."

#: includes/class-admin.php:939
msgid ""
"If wp_consent_statistics stays deny after Accept all, clear site cookies or "
"test in a private window, hard-refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R), and confirm the WP "
"Consent API plugin is active."
msgstr ""
"Če wp_consent_statistics po kliku Sprejmi vse ostane deny, izbrišite "
"piškotke spletnega mesta ali preizkusite v zasebnem oknu, izvedite trdo "
"osvežitev (Ctrl+Shift+R) in preverite, ali je vtičnik WP Consent API aktiven."

#: includes/class-admin.php:746 includes/class-admin.php:854
msgid "Advanced Consent Mode"
msgstr "Napredni Consent Mode"

#: includes/class-admin.php:750
msgid "Load Google tags before consent, with consent denied"
msgstr "Naloži oznake Google pred privolitvijo, z zavrnjeno privolitvijo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:753
msgid "Off (default, Basic Consent Mode): the Google tag is blocked until the visitor accepts analytics cookies, and Google Tag Manager until the visitor accepts analytics or marketing cookies, so Google receives nothing from visitors who have not consented."
msgstr ""
"Izklopljeno (privzeto, osnovni Consent Mode): oznaka Google je blokirana, "
"dokler obiskovalec ne sprejme analitičnih piškotkov, Google Tag Manager pa, "
"dokler obiskovalec ne sprejme analitičnih ali trženjskih piškotkov, zato "
"Google od obiskovalcev, ki niso dali privolitve, ne prejme ničesar."

#: includes/class-admin.php:756
msgid ""
"On (Advanced Consent Mode): the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load "
"right away. Until the visitor accepts, they set no cookies and send Google "
"only cookieless pings, which Google uses to model the missing data. Google "
"Analytics and Google Ads expect this mode, and with Basic mode they can "
"report your consent signals as not active."
msgstr ""
"Vklopljeno (napredni Consent Mode): oznaka Google in Google Tag Manager se "
"naložita takoj. Dokler obiskovalec ne sprejme, ne nastavljata piškotkov in "
"Googlu pošiljata samo pinge brez piškotkov, s katerimi Google modelira "
"manjkajoče podatke. Google Analytics in Google Ads pričakujeta ta način, pri "
"osnovnem načinu pa lahko vaše signale privolitve prikažeta kot neaktivne."

#: includes/class-admin.php:759
msgid "Only applies while Consent Mode v2 is enabled. Other tracking scripts on the site stay blocked until consent, also those that Google Tag Manager adds (for example a Meta Pixel or LinkedIn in a Custom HTML tag): each waits for its own category, with no changes needed in the container."
msgstr ""
"Velja samo, ko je Consent Mode v2 omogočen. Drugi sledilni skripti na "
"spletnem mestu ostanejo blokirani do privolitve, tudi tisti, ki jih doda "
"Google Tag Manager (na primer Meta Pixel ali LinkedIn v oznaki Custom HTML): "
"vsak čaka na svojo kategorijo, v vsebniku pa ni treba ničesar spreminjati."

#: includes/class-admin.php:854
msgid ""
"Off by default. When on, the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load before "
"consent instead of being blocked. Until the visitor accepts, they set no "
"cookies and send Google only cookieless pings."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto izklopljeno. Ko je vklopljeno, se oznaka Google in Google Tag "
"Manager naložita pred privolitvijo, namesto da bi bila blokirana. Dokler "
"obiskovalec ne sprejme, ne nastavljata piškotkov in Googlu pošiljata samo "
"pinge brez piškotkov."

#: includes/class-admin.php:863
msgid "You can turn this off on the Script Blocking tab."
msgstr "To lahko izklopite na zavihku Blokiranje skriptov."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1136
msgid ""
"Advanced Consent Mode is on (Integration tab): the Google tag and Google "
"Tag Manager load before consent and follow the Consent Mode signals instead "
"of being blocked."
msgstr ""
"Napredni Consent Mode je vklopljen (zavihek Integracija): oznaka Google in "
"Google Tag Manager se naložita pred privolitvijo in namesto blokiranja "
"upoštevata signale Consent Mode."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1168
msgid ""
"Block YouTube and Vimeo videos until the visitor accepts marketing cookies"
msgstr ""
"Blokiraj videoposnetke YouTube in Vimeo, dokler obiskovalec ne sprejme "
"trženjskih piškotkov"

#: includes/class-admin.php:684
msgid "More information"
msgstr "Več informacij"

#: includes/class-admin.php:823
msgid "Basic Consent Mode: the Google tag waits until the visitor accepts analytics cookies, and Google Tag Manager until the visitor accepts analytics or marketing cookies."
msgstr ""
"Osnovni Consent Mode: oznaka Google počaka, da obiskovalec sprejme "
"analitične piškotke, Google Tag Manager pa, da obiskovalec sprejme "
"analitične ali trženjske piškotke."

#: includes/class-admin.php:823
msgid ""
"Advanced Consent Mode: the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load right "
"away with these defaults, and send only cookieless pings until the visitor "
"accepts."
msgstr ""
"Napredni Consent Mode: oznaka Google in Google Tag Manager se s temi "
"privzetimi vrednostmi naložita takoj in pošiljata samo pinge brez piškotkov, "
"dokler obiskovalec ne sprejme."

